<title>
Neutral Position Switch On-Vehicle Inspection (If Equipped)
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove left front wheel. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A2406001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect neutral position switch connector.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove neutral position switch connector from engine harness MT bracket.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check neutral position switch (1) function using ohmmeter.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Neutral position switch specification
</title>
<ptxt>
Neutral position: Continuity exists
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Other than neutral position: No continuity
</ptxt>
</spec>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A523007.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "62.974mm" ver = "01" gw = "221" gh = "162"/>
